    "diagnosis": "Flow cytometry of peripheral T-cell lymphoma NOS",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Only T&nbsp;cells (CD3-positive) are shown. <strong>A,B</strong>&nbsp;A suspicious population (purple) is CD2 dim positive and CD4-positive. The CD8 T&nbsp;cells (green) are brighter for CD2. A CD4-positive population with similar CD2 intensity to the CD8 T&nbsp;cells is shown in orange. <strong>C</strong>&nbsp;95% of the purple T&nbsp;cells are TRBC1-positive, indicating a monoclonal population. By contrast, 59% of the other CD4-positive T&nbsp;cells (orange) are TRBC1-positive, and 33% of the CD8-positive T&nbsp;cells (green) are TRBC1-positive, indicating polyclonal populations.",
